{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12308180","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12308180","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1230818001:1":{"text":"If you're asking where they are now... there is no \"now\" for them.","source_cn":"你问我后来……我只能说。他们都没有了“后来”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF597A6095C93B9C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230818002:1":{"text":"If I hadn't kept my cool and joined the Water Wights with them, there's no way I'd be sitting here now!","source_cn":"当时要是我没沉住气，和伙伴一起加入水鬼帮，现在就没机会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x925A362F665EC5FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230818003:1":{"text":"They say the Dead Tide Fleet is cooperating with the Water Wights, but in reality, they're just using them as cannon fodder... they don't care if they live or die!","source_cn":"据说死潮舰队表面和水鬼帮合作，其实是把水鬼帮当炮灰，他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7AD8A6858D8B4DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1230818004:1":{"text":"None of my friends survived...","source_cn":"我那几个朋友，都没能活过那次混战。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7C5FDDFFE44E4BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1230818005:1":{"text":"It's all so dreadful!","source_cn":"这也太可怕了！","statu